# Netlify redirect rules for corecredit.idlery.com
#
# The app, the App Store listing and the bundled legal documents all point at the
# extensionless forms of these three addresses. App Review opens the support and privacy
# URLs, and a 404 on either is a rejection, so they are stated here explicitly rather than
# left to Netlify's automatic pretty-URL handling.
#
# 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect: the address in the browser stays /support.

/support    /support.html    200
/privacy    /privacy.html    200
/terms      /terms.html      200

# Unmatched paths fall through to 404.html, which Netlify serves automatically.
